              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>The patient shows significantly reduced glomerular filtration rate (GFR), indicating stage 3b chronic kidney disease. This suggests moderate to severe impairment of renal function. Clinical correlation and further nephrological evaluation are recommended, especially considering the patient’s advanced age. Regular monitoring of renal function and assessment for potential complications are advised.</td></tr></table></div>"
